Source: Reagan Library, George Shultz
                    Papers, Executive Secretariat Sensitive (10/01/1988–10/15/1988);
                    NLR–775–17–61–6–0. No classification marking.

For documentation on the IMF funding increase of
                    1983, see the Foreign Assistance; International Financial Institutions;
                    Commodity Policy compilation in this volume. Documentation is also scheduled for
                    publication in Foreign
                            Relations, 1981–1988, vol. XXXVI, Trade; Monetary Policy;
                        Industrialized Country Cooperation, 1981–1984.
